  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 182679101440
    m_Localized: "You stand at the threshold of a great task. As a young leader,
      you have been entrusted with a mission that will shape the future of a rising
      kingdom. Before you stretches an untamed valley \u2014 a land full of opportunity,
      but also of challenges. Your goal is to find a place that will become a home
      for your people.\n\nListen to the rhythm of the river, observe the fertile
      soil, and choose land that will ensure the survival of your first settlers.
      Here, the foundations of a future city will be laid \u2014 the beginning of
      a power that may endure for generations.\n\nYour decisions will determine the
      fate of those who have placed their trust in you. Will you lead them to prosperity,
      or condemn them to struggle for survival? It is time to begin building."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
